OL,3,AWill.i.am backs campaign for Sir Tom
OL,4,AJones to return to The Voice
OL,5,
OL,6,FWill.i.am has endorsed a petition to
OL,7,Fhave Sir Tom Jones reinstated on ITV's
OL,8,FThe Voice.
OL,10,FSir Tom told his social media followers
OL,11,Fearlier this month that the broadcaster
OL,12,Fhad "fired" him as a judge on the show.
OL,14,FThe 86-year-old singer from Treforest,
OL,15,FRhondda Cynon Taf, has appeared as an
OL,16,Fon-off coach on the singing competition
OL,17,Fsince it premiered in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
